    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Age of Great Geographical Discoveries, the disappearance of entire fleets was not seen as anything extraordinary. Among tales of immense riches and breathtaking new lands, one legend was nearly forgotten \u2014 the myth of the Neverseas. It would have remained a bedtime story if not for one crucial detail: brave explorers found their way there and back. What they witnessed made the riches of the New World pale in comparison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mighty nations did not hesitate. Rumors turned into orders \u2014 armadas set sail into the unknown. Thus began a new race for power and resources, with dominance over the world beyond the ocean gates at stake.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/ec1c53f9c6e56666264b5781e8b1efe5.poster.avif?t=1752165888\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/ec1c53f9c6e56666264b5781e8b1efe5.webm?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/ec1c53f9c6e56666264b5781e8b1efe5.mp4?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neverseas</strong> is a third-person action RPG with tactical elements, set in an open sea world filled with danger, battles, and intrigue. Expect large-scale naval warfare, covert operations on enemy islands, and a fight for survival among the ambitions of empires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/3e8904ff973bfa918056396e2563101b.poster.avif?t=1752165888\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/3e8904ff973bfa918056396e2563101b.webm?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/3e8904ff973bfa918056396e2563101b.mp4?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of a warship, caught in the heart of a global conflict. Assemble your crew, upgrade your ship, explore uncharted lands, and make difficult choices that will shape the future of the entire archipelago. Will you remain loyal to your nation, or forge your own path? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Sea World: Explore islands, archipelagos, and mysterious lands hidden beyond the ocean gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naval Battles: Engage in tactical combat where maneuvering, equipment selection, and crew management are key.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/79de276b48048b24ebd6ffef39a9cae3.poster.avif?t=1752165888\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/79de276b48048b24ebd6ffef39a9cae3.webm?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/79de276b48048b24ebd6ffef39a9cae3.mp4?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of Choice: Support one of the factions or go rogue, influencing the course of the war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ground Missions: Land on enemy territories, gather resources, and uncover the secrets of the ancient world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/e4392fa111f5747a4c30e24e3171b408.poster.avif?t=1752165888\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/e4392fa111f5747a4c30e24e3171b408.webm?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/e4392fa111f5747a4c30e24e3171b408.mp4?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crew Development: Recruit unique crew members, improve their skills, specializations, and combat abilities to build a truly effective and cohesive team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship Upgrades: Enhance your ship\u2019s weapons, armor, sails, cargo holds, and internal systems to suit your playstyle and strategic goals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/cd07c4e9688938c293a14f97715350a4.poster.avif?t=1752165888\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/cd07c4e9688938c293a14f97715350a4.webm?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/cd07c4e9688938c293a14f97715350a4.mp4?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimagined Ship Management: Commanding a ship isn\u2019t just about heading and sails \u2014 it\u2019s comprehensive control over all ship systems, from artillery to supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-Reactive Procedural World: The world evolves based on your choices, affecting dangers, opportunities, and exploration paths.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/512163555cb68310e2f55cceed28bb62.poster.avif?t=1752165888\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/512163555cb68310e2f55cceed28bb62.webm?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/512163555cb68310e2f55cceed28bb62.mp4?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Economy and Factions: Your actions influence trade, alliances, and enmities \u2014 every interaction, whether looting a colony or attacking a trade convoy, leaves a mark and shifts the balance of power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take command and face the mysteries hidden within the Neverseas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Age of Great Geographical Discoveries, the disappearance of entire fleets was not seen as anything extraordinary. Among tales of immense riches and breathtaking new lands, one legend was nearly forgotten \u2014 the myth of the Neverseas. It would have remained a bedtime story if not for one crucial detail: brave explorers found their way there and back. What they witnessed made the riches of the New World pale in comparison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mighty nations did not hesitate. Rumors turned into orders \u2014 armadas set sail into the unknown. Thus began a new race for power and resources, with dominance over the world beyond the ocean gates at stake.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/ec1c53f9c6e56666264b5781e8b1efe5.poster.avif?t=1752165888\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/ec1c53f9c6e56666264b5781e8b1efe5.webm?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/ec1c53f9c6e56666264b5781e8b1efe5.mp4?t=1752165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neverseas</strong> is a third-person action RPG with tactical elements, set in an open sea world filled with danger, battles, and intrigue. Expect large-scale naval warfare, covert operations on enemy islands, and a fight for survival among the ambitions of empires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/3e8904ff973bfa918056396e2563101b.poster.avif?t=1752165888\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto